check 1
# Census: spending stat points (combat/vitals.md §2, message 0x3A): level 10
# with 25 unspent points; one point to each of strength (0), energy (1),
# dexterity (2), vitality (3), then a repeat of 5 on vitality and a point
# on an invalid stat. State and rng channels.
name sys-statpoints
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion --level 10 --stat 4=25
seed 1234
ticks 70
seconds 300
channels state rng packets
at 10 send AddStatPoint stat=0 repeat=1
at 14 send AddStatPoint stat=1 repeat=1
at 18 send AddStatPoint stat=2 repeat=1
at 22 send AddStatPoint stat=3 repeat=1
at 26 send AddStatPoint stat=3 repeat=5
at 30 send AddStatPoint stat=7 repeat=1
